  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Dev Script Details**\n\nOkay, I\'m currently focused on dissecting the `dev` and `build` scripts for Express + Vite fullstack applications, specifically how `server.ts` is handled. I am investigating the requirements laid out in the system instructions and considering the implications for development and deployment, respectively. The `\"dev\"` script looks straightforward, but I am now paying particular attention to the nuances of the `\"build\"` script.\n\n\n**Orchestrating AI Backend**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the AI model orchestration within the Express server. Specifically, I\'m defining the key components: standardized Gemini API key integration, alongside optional support for user-configured keys (Groq, OpenRouter, Tavily). If the optional keys are absent, I will default to smartly simulating distinct LLM agent personas, such as **GPT-4o/ChatGPT Emulated Agent**.\n\n\n**Defining Agent Orchestration**\n\nI\'m now integrating detailed agent logic, focusing on the three-step pipeline. Step one involves parallel generation using emulated personas: a pragmatic ChatGPT agent, a nuanced Claude 3.5 agent, and a concise Llama 3.3 agent. A fact-grounded Perplexity agent also provides search grounding. This enables a robust draft phase, supporting zero-cost operations and honoring all prompt requirements.\n\n\n**Refining Agent Synthesis**\n\nNow I\'m diving deeper into the Judge phase, focusing on synthesis. The strongest model will process all inputs to create a JSON output. I\'m prioritizing `consensusAnswer` and `keyAgreedPoints` as crucial elements. It must be a clear, verified master answer. I am also planning on including  `divergentPoints`, to highlight areas of disagreement. I am focusing on generating the highest quality output for the user, with a comprehensive verdict.\n\n\n**Integrating UI Feature Set**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the UI features for the AI Consensus Hub. I\'m focusing on the integration of specific data points from the backend into the UI. I\'m thinking about including a confidence score for overall agent agreement and fact verifiability, plus a model agreement matrix. Furthermore, I must remember the option to list web search sources and references. I\'m refining the UI components and data flow, including a header with a live status indicator.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 524537993
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
