        lines {
          text: "### 3. Rate-Limit & Optimization Strategies"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Token Constraint Engineering**: Restricting draft token size reduces execution time by 60% and preserves free quota."
