  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Documenting The Build**\n\nI\'m pleased to report a clean and successful build. My focus has now shifted to crafting a detailed implementation guide for the \"DeezYap\" Yellow. This guide will outline all necessary files, color tokens, and modification steps to empower seamless user implementation and customization of this specific design element.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "Here is a step-by-step implementation guide for **DeezYap** with the modern minimal **Yellow & Black** theme, along with the file structure and styling breakdown so you can easily customize and add your own touch.\n\n---\n\n### Design System & Theme Tokens\n\nThe **DeezYap** aesthetic is built on a high-contrast dark industrial canvas with vibrant yellow and amber accents:\n\n* **Primary Canvas Background**: `bg-black` and `bg-zinc-950`\n* **Card Borders & Dividers**: `border-zinc-800` and `border-zinc-900`\n* **Primary Accent Color**: `text-yellow-400`, `bg-yellow-400`, `border-yellow-400/30`\n* **Secondary Accent Color**: `text-amber-400` (for cross-critiques & warnings)\n* **Typography**: Heavy, bold sans-serif headers (`font-black uppercase tracking-wider`) paired with readable body text (`text-zinc-200`) and monospace metrics (`font-mono`).\n\n---\n\n### Step-by-Step Implementation Guide\n\n#### Step 1: App Metadata (`metadata.json`)\nUpdate the app manifest to reflect the new **DeezYap** identity.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"DeezYap\",\n  \"description\": \"Multi-agent AI debate and consensus engine synthesized into one definitive answer.\",\n  \"requestFramePermissions\": [],\n  \"majorCapabilities\": [\"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\"]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n#### Step 2: Agent Definitions & Color Classes (`src/data/agents.ts`)\nMap each AI model to the yellow & black theme palette:\n\n```typescript\nexport const AGENTS: Record<AgentId, AgentConfig> = {\n  gpt4o: {\n    id: \'gpt4o\',\n    name: \'ChatGPT (GPT-4o)\',\n    provider: \'OpenAI\',\n    badge: \'ChatGPT\',\n    avatar: \'\360\237\237\242\',\n    color: \'yellow\',\n    bgColor: \'bg-yellow-400/10\',\n    textColor: \'text-yellow-400\',\n    borderColor: \'border-yellow-400/30\',\n  },\n  claude: {\n    id: \'claude\',\n    name: \'Claude 3.5 Sonnet\',\n    provider: \'Anthropic\',\n    badge: \'Claude\',\n    avatar: \'\360\237\237\240\',\n    color: \'amber\',\n    bgColor: \'bg-amber-400/10\',\n    textColor: \'text-amber-400\',\n    borderColor: \'border-amber-400/30\',\n  },\n  // ... Configure remaining models (Groq, Perplexity, Gemini) with yellow/amber highlights\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n#### Step 3: Top Navigation Bar (`src/components/Header.tsx`)\nConstruct the main header with the bold yellow **DeezYap** branding and control buttons:\n\n```tsx\n<header className=\"border-b border-zinc-800 bg-black/90 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-40\">\n  <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\">\n    <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n      <div className=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-yellow-400 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-black text-xl shadow-lg shadow-yellow-400/20\">\n        DY\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h1 className=\"text-xl font-black tracking-wider text-white uppercase flex items-center gap-2\">\n          DeezYap\n          <span className=\"text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-yellow-400/10 text-yellow-400 border border-yellow-400/30\">\n            PRO V1.0\n          </span>\n        </h1>\n        <p className=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 font-medium\">Multi-Agent AI Debate & Consensus Engine</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    {/* Action Buttons: Blueprint, Keys, History */}\n  </div>\n</header>\n```\n\n---\n\n#### Step 4: Prompt Input & Mode Selector (`src/components/PromptInput.tsx`)\nBuild the central input component with preset chips and debate mode toggles:\n\n* **Presets**: High-contrast dark chips (`bg-zinc-900 hover:border-yellow-400/50`)\n* **Mode Tabs**: Full consensus, speed debate, and deep audit modes with `bg-yellow-400 text-black` active states\n* **Submit Button**: High-visibility yellow CTA button (`bg-yellow-400 hover:bg-yellow-300 text-black font-black`)\n\n---\n\n#### Step 5: Live Execution Stepper (`src/components/ProgressStepper.tsx`)\nDisplay live status updates during multi-round consensus computation:\n\n* **Active Round Indicator**: `text-yellow-400 bg-yellow-400/10 border-yellow-400/30`\n* **Progress Bar**: `bg-yellow-400 h-full transition-all duration-500`\n\n---\n\n#### Step 6: Consensus Output Card (`src/components/ConsensusCard.tsx`)\nStyle the primary synthesized verdict output:\n\n* **Confidence Score Gauge**: Yellow ring border with `text-yellow-400` percentage readout\n* **Grounding Sources**: `bg-yellow-400/10 text-yellow-300 border-yellow-400/30`\n* **Action Buttons**: Quick copy and download consensus report options\n\n---\n\n#### Step 7: Debate Arena & Alignment Matrix (`src/components/DebateArena.tsx` & `src/components/AlignmentMatrix.tsx`)\nRender the round-by-round model stances and agreement metrics:\n\n* **Model Filter Tabs**: Switch between viewing all models or individual agent drafts\n* **Round Cards**: Clean black cards with yellow border hover states (`hover:border-yellow-400/50`)\n* **Alignment Matrix Bars**: Visual percentage agreement bars rendered in yellow\n\n---\n\n#### Step 8: Modals & History Sidebar (`src/components/HistorySidebar.tsx`, `ArchitectureModal.tsx`, `ApiKeysModal.tsx`)\nFinish the application drawers and dialogs:\n\n* **History Drawer**: Search previous consensus runs stored in client memory\n* **Architecture Modal**: Display the $0 free-tier 3-step orchestration diagram in formatted ASCII code blocks\n* **Custom API Keys Modal**: Secure client-side key storage controls\n\n---\n\n### Project File Overview\n\n```\n/src\n \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 App.tsx                     # Main application orchestrator & state manager\n \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 data/\n \342\224\202    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 agents.ts              # Agent configurations & theme color mappings\n \342\224\202    \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 architectureBlueprint.ts# Free-tier architecture specification\n \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 components/\n \342\224\202    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Header.tsx             # Top navigation & DeezYap branding\n \342\224\202    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 PromptInput.tsx        # Query input, mode selector, preset chips\n \342\224\202    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ProgressStepper.tsx    # Live 3-round execution progress indicator\n \342\224\202    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ConsensusCard.tsx      # Synthesized master consensus output\n \342\224\202    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 AlignmentMatrix.tsx    # Model agreement percentage matrix\n \342\224\202    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 DebateArena.tsx        # Individual draft stances & cross-critiques\n \342\224\202    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 HistorySidebar.tsx     # Saved debate history drawer\n \342\224\202    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ArchitectureModal.tsx  # System architecture blueprint modal\n \342\224\202    \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 ApiKeysModal.tsx       # Optional developer API key modal\n \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 types.ts                    # TypeScript interface definitions\n```\n\nThe application is compiled and running cleanly in the live preview iframe. You can now test prompts or modify any of the component files directly to add your own customized tweaks!"
